WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:05.165
Welcome to Alaventra. Rank in
search. Get recommended by AI.

00:00:06.164 --> 00:00:10.914
In tutorial 2.1, you'll prove your
website is yours with your Google account,

00:00:10.964 --> 00:00:11.970
in one step.

00:00:13.020 --> 00:00:17.220
First, open Website settings,
then Verification & Google.

00:00:17.270 --> 00:00:20.789
Until you prove it's yours,
the website shows Not verified.

00:00:21.813 --> 00:00:25.493
Now choose Verify with
Google. It's marked Fastest,

00:00:25.543 --> 00:00:28.676
because there's nothing to add
to your website or your domain.

00:00:29.685 --> 00:00:32.840
Need help? Click Show
me how, step by step.

00:00:32.890 --> 00:00:36.205
Under If it does not work, you'll find
what to do if you're not an owner.

00:00:38.135 --> 00:00:40.935
When you're ready, click
Verify with Google.

00:00:40.985 --> 00:00:44.560
Then pick the Google account that
owns your site in Search Console,

00:00:44.610 --> 00:00:48.485
Google's free tool for website
owners. The check is read-only,

00:00:48.535 --> 00:00:50.028
and nothing is changed.

00:00:51.012 --> 00:00:55.662
Then you come straight back, verified.
The badge says Ownership verified,

00:00:55.712 --> 00:00:58.436
and your website's
dashboards and tracking open.

00:00:59.409 --> 00:01:04.684
Only owners and admins can verify. Not
an owner of the site in Search Console?

00:01:04.734 --> 00:01:07.991
Use a DNS record or a meta tag instead.

00:01:09.031 --> 00:01:13.191
So, open Verification & Google,
choose Verify with Google,

00:01:13.241 --> 00:01:16.668
click it and pick the owner
account, and come back verified.

00:01:17.708 --> 00:01:20.423
No Google owner? There are two other ways.

00:01:20.473 --> 00:01:25.837
Next, verify with a DNS record
or a meta tag, in tutorial 2.2.
